{
  "_comment": "Copy to development_tools/config/development_tools_config.json and customize. Top-level categories match the live config for this repo (see development_tools/LIST_OF_LISTS.md). Omit optional sections/keys that match development_tools/config/config.py defaults (workflow, documentation, auto_document, ai_validation, ai_collaboration, audit, output, status, system_signals, validation, unused_imports, quick_audit, analyze_module_dependencies, analyze_package_exports, and matching static_analysis / analyze_function_registry scalars). Other common omit-or-fallback sections: documentation_analysis, analyze_function_patterns, analyze_ai_work, backup_health, tool_commands, analyze_functions (FUNCTION_DISCOVERY), test_run, analyze_duplicate_functions. file_patterns in JSON merges with FILE_PATTERNS via get_file_patterns_config(). test_markers.directory_to_marker is derived from categories when absent. Quick-audit tool membership is audit_tiers (TIER1_*), not a JSON script list.",
  "project": {
    "name": "YourProject",
    "key_files": [
      "run_app.py",
      "core/service.py",
      "core/config.py"
    ]
  },
  "paths": {
    "project_root": ".",
    "docs_dir": "development_docs",
    "logs_dir": "logs",
    "data_dir": "data",
    "ai_docs_dir": "ai_development_docs",
    "development_docs_dir": "development_docs",
    "tests_dir": "tests",
    "tests_data_dir": "tests/data"
  },
